{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_08_end","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_08","title":"激战之末","storyCode":"MB-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"935644b0cb49ec7a0fd2165142183bf42cb3f96828f743f519ac753aad53f2b9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在杰斯顿的万全准备下，安东尼逐渐不敌，眼看越狱就要失败，塞雷娅及时赶到。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混账！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"没用的，安东尼老弟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"罗宾小姐，没想到你的战斗能力也相当出色，我越来越喜欢你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，现在帮助我的话，我依然可以原谅你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙的手到底是怎么回事，变黑之后变得好硬的样子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微为你介绍一下吧，我的源石技艺能力呢，是操控铁元素，而我的身体，接受过一些小小的改造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才的攻击是不是感觉打到了铁板上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"那不只是我的源石技艺的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我的皮肤下层，有着莱茵生命科技的结晶——一些小小的金属板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我并不清楚这东西的学名是什么，总之它能够大幅减少你进攻的威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是莱茵生命的人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不，很遗憾，我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，即使被抑制器限制，依然如此善战，真是令人吃惊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我也得拿出一些真本事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"他的手，变成了刀刃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，安东尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"从我来到这座监狱后，第一眼看到你的时候开始，我就感到了一种不协调。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你尽力在克制着自己，让自己显得无害，让自己显得有礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你的存在本身就是力量的彰显。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"从那时起，我就很期待现在这一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你撕开温文尔雅的伪装后，凶性毕露的样貌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"想必我没有令你失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我大开眼界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":true,"text":"你没有资格判断我的本性！！！吼！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":true,"text":"我也无意于这么做。我只是想说，现在的你，看着顺眼多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"连牙齿都用上了吗，啧啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，你的牙齿是撕不开我的表皮的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......可恶，可恶啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，其实，安东尼老弟，你出去又能做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你救得了你的父母？挽回得了你的家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我告诉你，出去之后，你将一无所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明在这座监狱里过得很好，甚至连典狱长都要礼让你三分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我刚才说我早就可以下手，但其实没有那么轻松，如果你不打算越狱，我想要解决你也需要付出不小的代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"何必呢，就这么留在这座监狱里过你的日子不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......六年前的7月24日，我正打算去参加一场晚宴，保镖忽然告诉我，家里出事了，父亲让我逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道发生了什么事，甚至没有见到父亲母亲一面，就踏上了逃亡的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"在逃到铸铁城后，我还是被捕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时以为到此为止了，但在进入这座监狱后没多久，我就发现，或许不是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里得到了一个囚犯本不应有的优待，我马上意识到了，我的入狱，恐怕也是我父亲安排好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"真巧，我也是这么认为的。既然你也这么想，那就更不应该辜负你父亲的意愿了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我父亲的意愿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......你似乎很喜欢站在高处为别人设计想法和路线，杰斯顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有人告诉过你，你很小器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"......曾经有人对我说过类似的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但恐怕，我的器量大小与否，与你能否完成越狱无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以在这里生活得很舒服，甚至能够将这里改造成属于我的王国。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但这又怎么样呢？我只不过是一个最自由的囚犯罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里生活了六年，这六年里，我无时不刻想要出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要出去，不是为了证明我有多了不起，而是我要搞清楚究竟发生了什么，我要告诉那些让我家破人亡的人，我们还没完！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，你这番慷慨激昂的发言让我开始有些讨厌你了，安东尼老弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不过算了，无论如何，你也出不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我暂时无法打败你，我也已经拖延了足够久的时间，其他警卫应该也要解除封锁赶过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你做得很好，你的同伴们也做得很好，这并不是你的过错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这片大地上就是有那么多不尽人意的事情发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，你的越狱到此为止了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"听，死神来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"到此为止了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，怎么办怎么办......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，死神暂时不会来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，安东尼，你的声音太大了，我在过道里都听到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，你们的计划连我都感到有些出乎意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"花了一些时间才帮你们堵住了其他那些警卫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我好像见过你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命，防卫科主任，塞雷娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"我也记得你，杰斯顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到您这样的大人物居然还记得我，真是荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"能来到我手上的简历并不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"而我也始终记得被您亲口告知不合格的那一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但首先，我很好奇，堂堂防卫科主任怎么会出现在这样一所监狱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"这点不用你操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要知道，你该退场了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"......退场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，你似乎搞错了什么，塞雷娅主任，不，塞雷娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我听闻你的能力与我有几分相似，但还没有与你交过手，就被你拒之门外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，我都对于你是否真的强过我，抱有一丝小小的疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，机会来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"她手的颜色也变了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"好白，好漂亮......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技艺确实与我有几分相似之处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我应当告诉过你，杰斯顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你太过安于现状且没有坚持，我的手下不需要这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的器量，太小了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可恶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要你还是现在这样毫无坚持的浮萍，来多少次我都会拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"闪开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_10_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，闪开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞......雷，娅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"太、太强了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然以前也听说过防卫科的主任很厉害，但这也太猛了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好我没惹过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，塞......塞雷娅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，还能动的话，继续动起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"不过在那之前，我有一个问题要问你，安东尼•西蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"请问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有听说过，斐尔迪南这个名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"斐尔迪南......我从父亲那里听说过这个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"斐尔迪南，果然是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["安东尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["罗宾"]}]}
